# Landing domains allowed to open the paid payment form (pay.*).
#
# Copy this file to `paid_gate_domains.txt` next to the bot and list one
# domain per line. A listed domain also admits all of its subdomains.
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored. The file is re-read
# automatically when it changes — no restart needed.
#
# IMPORTANT: while `paid_gate_domains.txt` is missing OR has no domains, the
# gate is OFF and the payment form is open to everyone. Emptying, deleting or
# renaming the file is the emergency kill switch.
#
# Example:
# dino-vpn-landing.ru
# promo.example.com
